2. In these Regulations—

"register" means a register maintain and keep by the Secretary for the purposes

of these Regulations;

"Committee" means the Sports Dispute Committee established under Part VI

of the Act;

"applicant" means a member ofa sports body or sports body who refers a dispute

to the Sports Dispute Committee under section 24 of the Act;

"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Sports Dispute Committee appointed

under paragraph 28(1)(a) of the Act;

"respondent" means a member of a sports body or sports body who is named

as the other party by the applicant in a referral of a dispute;

"Secretary" means the Commissioner appointed under subsection 29(1)

of the Act including any public officer appointed under subsection 29(2) of the Act.

Application of referral of dispute

text.ms:
2. Dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini—

"daftar" ertinya suatu daftar yang disenggara dan disimpan oleh Setiausaha

bagi maksud Peraturan-Peraturan ini;

"Jawatankuasa" ertinya Jawatankuasa Pertikaian Sukan yang ditubuhkan

di bawah Bahagian VI Akta;

"pemohon" ertinya anggota suatu badan sukan atau badan sukan yang merujuk

pertikaian kepada Jawatankuasa Pertikaian Sukan di bawah seksyen 24 Akta;

"Pengerusi" ertinya Pengerusi Jawatankuasa Pertikaian Sukan yang dilantik

di bawah perenggan 28(1)(a) Akta;

"responden" ertinya anggota badan sukan atau badan sukan yang dinamakan

sebagai pihak yang satu lagi oleh pemohon dalam rujukan pertikaian;

"Setiausaha" ertinya Pesuruhjaya yang dilantik di bawah subseksyen 29(1) Akta

termasuk mana-mana pegawai awam yang dilantik di bawah subseksyen 29(2) Akta.

Permohonan rujukan pertikaian
